{title: Tumhawar Keli Mi Marji Bahal}
{artist: Pinjara Usha Mangeshkar}
{key: G#}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#] [G] [A],        Tumhavar keli mi marji bahal
[A] [G#],        naka sodun jau, rangamahal
[C#m] [G#],        papnyanchi toran bandhun dolyavarti
[C#m] [G#],        hi najar udhalite kaljatali pitri
[C#m] [A] [G#]
javali yaava, malaa pusav, gupit maz khushal
[G#],        gupit maza khushal
[C#m] [G#],        hurhur mhanu ki odha mhanu hi goad
[C#m] [G#],        ya basa manchaki, sutal gulabi kod
[C#m] [A] [G#],        virah jalita mala raat hi pasari mayajal
[G#],        pasari mayajal
[C#m] [G#],        lade-lade adabina tumha vinavite bai
[C#m] [G#],        piraticha ughadala pinjara tumachya payi
[C#m] [A] [G#]
ashich rahavi raat sajana kadhi na vhavi sakaal
[G#],        kadhi na vhavi sakaal
